{
  "declaredLength": 9164,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Ça alors, regarde un peu ce Bleuseille !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C7006100200061006C006F00720073002C0020007200650067006100720064006500200075006E002000700065007500200063006500200042006C00650075007300650069006C006C00650020002100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il tient ce vieux mouchoir en soie comme si\nc’était la chose la plus précieuse du monde !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être qu’il cherche la personne à qui\nil appartient ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750074002D00EA00740072006500200071007520190069006C002000630068006500720063006800650020006C006100200070006500720073006F006E006E0065002000E00020007100750069000A0069006C002000610070007000610072007400690065006E00740020003F00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais les seuls indices que j’ai sont ce mouchoir\net un nom brodé dessus : « <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Dustin<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> »...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bleu !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006C0065007500200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Regarde ! Il a réagi au nom « Dustin » !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006700610072006400650020002100200049006C002000610020007200E90061006700690020006100750020006E006F006D002000AB002000440075007300740069006E002000BB0020002100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu ne connaîtrais pas quelqu’un qui saurait\nidentifier ce genre de tissu ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si, je peux demander à mon ami Inno.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069002C0020006A006500200070006500750078002000640065006D0061006E006400650072002000E00020006D006F006E00200061006D006900200049006E006E006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si, je peux demander à mon amie Rudi.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069002C0020006A006500200070006500750078002000640065006D0061006E006400650072002000E00020006D006F006E00200061006D0069006500200052007500640069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un mouchoir ? Désolée, je peux pas t’aider...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTu devrais plutôt demander à Inno, il s’y connaît\nmieux que moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un mouchoir ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F007500630068006F006900720020003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je m’y connais assez bien en tissus, mais je ne\npeux pas te dire à qui il appartient en le voyant...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah ! Mais peut-être que Tihana pourrait t’aider ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002000210020004D00610069007300200070006500750074002D00EA007400720065002000710075006500200054006900680061006E006100200070006F007500720072006100690074002000742019006100690064006500720020003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu te souviens d’elle ?\nC’est la fille de chez Chic-à-Porter.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nElle est excentrique, mais c’est une pro.\nElle pourra identifier n’importe quel bout de tissu.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 164
    },
    {
      "displayText": "N’abandonne pas, je suis sûr que tu arriveras\nà trouver à qui ce mouchoir appartient !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On dirait que tu as déjà trouvé une piste !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVas-y, poursuis l’enquête de ton côté. Nous\ndevons trouver à qui appartient ce mouchoir.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nOn ne peut pas décevoir ce Bleuseille !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 183
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous devons trouver à qui appartient le mouchoir.\nOn ne peut pas décevoir ce Bleuseille !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bleu !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006C0065007500200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est moi, Tihana, la designeuse qui a horreur\ndes étiquettes ! Je t’ai déjà vu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux à nouveau disputer un combat de\nMéga-Évolutions au summum du « staïle » ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourriez-vous regarder ce mouchoir ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00750072007200690065007A002D0076006F007500730020007200650067006100720064006500720020006300650020006D006F007500630068006F006900720020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourriez-vous regarder ce mouchoir ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00750072007200690065007A002D0076006F007500730020007200650067006100720064006500720020006300650020006D006F007500630068006F006900720020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourriez-vous regarder ce mouchoir ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00750072007200690065007A002D0076006F007500730020007200650067006100720064006500720020006300650020006D006F007500630068006F006900720020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, je vois ! T’es venu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe tester mes connaissances\nen matière de mode ? Je relève le défi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors... Voyons voir...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002E002E002E00200056006F0079006F006E007300200076006F00690072002E002E002E001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est très sale, mais le motif et le tissu\nm’indiquent qu’il vient de la région de Galar.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPlus précisément, c’est un mouchoir distribué\naux nouveaux élèves de l’école de Winscor.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nJe dirais que ce modèle date d’il y a trois ans.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 239
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu peux me dire où t’as trouvé ce mouchoir ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000700065007500780020006D0065002000640069007200650020006F00F900200074201900610073002000740072006F0075007600E90020006300650020006D006F007500630068006F006900720020003F001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est un Bleuseille qui l’avait.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200075006E00200042006C00650075007300650069006C006C006500200071007500690020006C201900610076006100690074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On cherche à qui il appartient.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200063006800650072006300680065002000E0002000710075006900200069006C002000610070007000610072007400690065006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chercher une personne disparue avec pour seul\nindice un nom brodé sur un morceau de tissu...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nÇa, c’est une histoire qui a du « staïle » !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À ta place, j’irais à l’Institut Nivers !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi cette personne est en visite à Illumis,\nil ou elle doit probablement s’y trouver.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si la personne à qui appartient ce mouchoir est à\nIllumis, tu devrais la trouver à l’Institut Nivers.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seille !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650069006C006C006500200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qu’il lui prend, à ce Bleuseille ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007520190069006C0020006C007500690020007000720065006E0064002C002000E000200063006500200042006C00650075007300650069006C006C00650020003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé, mais, attends un peu... Je te connais...\nC’est toi, MINISANGE ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E9002C0020006D006100690073002C00200061007400740065006E0064007300200075006E0020007000650075002E002E002E0020004A006500200074006500200063006F006E006E006100690073002E002E002E000A0043201900650073007400200074006F0069002C0020004D0049004E004900530041004E004700450020003F002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seille !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650069006C006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais c’est pas possible ! On s’est rencontrés à\nGalar... T’as traversé la mer pour me retrouver ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seille !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 6120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650069006C006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais t’étais blessé... et si petit...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200074201900E9007400610069007300200062006C00650073007300E9002E002E002E002000650074002000730069002000700065007400690074002E002E002E00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es venu me chercher jusqu’ici, à Illumis,\naprès mon déménagement ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054201900650073002000760065006E00750020006D00650020006300680065007200630068006500720020006A00750073007100752019006900630069002C002000E000200049006C006C0075006D00690073002C000A00610070007200E800730020006D006F006E0020006400E9006D00E9006E006100670065006D0065006E00740020003F002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça alors, j’arrive pas à y croire !\nT’es incroyable !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C7006100200061006C006F00720073002C0020006A20190061007200720069007600650020007000610073002000E000200079002000630072006F00690072006500200021000A005420190065007300200069006E00630072006F007900610062006C00650020002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seille !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650069006C006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et vous... vous avez aidé Bleuseille à me retrouver,\nc’est bien ça ? Merci ! Merci beaucoup !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous... vous croyez que je peux faire de Bleuseille\nmon partenaire ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F00750073002E002E002E00200076006F00750073002000630072006F00790065007A00200071007500650020006A00650020007000650075007800200066006100690072006500200064006500200042006C00650075007300650069006C006C0065000A006D006F006E002000700061007200740065006E00610069007200650020003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Évidemment !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C90076006900640065006D006D0065006E0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pense que ça lui ferait très plaisir !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000700065006E007300650020007100750065002000E700610020006C00750069002000660065007200610069007400200074007200E8007300200070006C00610069007300690072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et du coup... Je peux abuser encore un peu et\nvous demander un petit combat contre nous ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vous laisse vous préparer !\nRevenez me voir quand vous serez prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bleu !",
