    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Est-ce que vous voulez bien nous accorder\nun combat, à Bleuseille et à moi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 7348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 7512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000670061007200640065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 7536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, mais faites vite ! J’ai hâte de voir de quoi est\ncapable Bleuseille !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es assez fort pour traverser la mer. Montre-moi\nce que tu peux faire contre ce<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̀tte Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’en fais pas pour cette défaite, Bleuseille,\nt’as été extraordinaire ! Je suis fier de toi !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe te promets que je ferai de mon mieux pour\ndevenir un Dresseur digne de toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 7968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 181
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais... T’es fort ! T’es super fort, Bleuseille !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe te promets que je ferai de mon mieux pour\ndevenir un Dresseur digne de toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 8332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bleu !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 8608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006C00650075002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci encore pour tout !\nJ’oublierai jamais ce que vous avez fait pour moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 8624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci... Merci du fond du cœur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 8788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002E002E002E0020004D006500720063006900200064007500200066006F006E0064002000640075002000630153007500720020002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bleuseille... Maintenant, toi et moi,\nc’est pour la vie !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 8864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006C00650075007300650069006C006C0065002E002E002E0020004D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E0074002C00200074006F00690020006500740020006D006F0069002C000A0063201900650073007400200070006F007500720020006C006100200076006900650020002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
